  <Settings>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a4621c90bf8b4fb4f8d530d842f8c4a0, type: 2}
  description: 'The Consortium''s flagship rises over the deep ocean of Thalassa: the Leviathan, a flying fortress with a fleet in its hangars. End the Iron Tide.'
  introduces: 'The final battle of the Iron Tide: the Leviathan''s wings, hangars and reactor crown.'
  hints:
  - 'Its hangars launch drones until they fall: take them early in the second phase.'
  - 'The reactor crown opens last: keep a shield for it.'
